    "updated_at": "2021-10-24T14:48:02Z",
    "body": "If you only want a select few modules to be enabled, this would best be done by setting the root-level `format` value.\r\n\r\nFor instance, the following would give you a minimal, directory-only prompt:\r\n```toml\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n$directory\\\r\n$newline\\\r\n$character\r\n\"\"\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf the modules you'd like to include are disabled-by-default, they would additionally need to be enabled separately.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
